    "detailed_description": "Genokids is a game about <strong>MOTIVATION</strong>, a fast-paced hack&amp;slash where a band of musicians take down an alien invasion!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as 4 characters at the same time, each with their own moveset!<br></li><li>Smoothly navigate through the ruins of Las Divas using slick parkour moves.<br></li><li>Style your way through waves of enemies, what's the point of saving the world if you don't look cool doing it?<br></li><li>Follow the bombastic tale of this band of misfits as they make the impossible, possible.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/576cd0b7fcd2e190d46e35e48da58be6.poster.avif?t=1753714995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/576cd0b7fcd2e190d46e35e48da58be6.webm?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/576cd0b7fcd2e190d46e35e48da58be6.mp4?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A bizarre music band named Genokids is rocking one of their best concerts to date when <strong>The Infinite Empire of Zenodia</strong> decides to invade Earth and assimilate mankind, landing right on top of the band and ruining both their concert and mood.<br><br>Seamlessly swap between all four characters in the middle of a fight. Execute multiple actions at the same time!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/2236caa99c250b19680b6159c51228ec.poster.avif?t=1753714995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/2236caa99c250b19680b6159c51228ec.webm?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/2236caa99c250b19680b6159c51228ec.mp4?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Go beyond your limits and enter HYPER MODE!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/6592795fc33e2ed6bada6a8d88e30cd7.poster.avif?t=1753714995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/6592795fc33e2ed6bada6a8d88e30cd7.webm?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/6592795fc33e2ed6bada6a8d88e30cd7.mp4?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>MOTIVATION IS MANKIND'S GREATEST WEAPON!",
    "about_the_game": "Genokids is a game about <strong>MOTIVATION</strong>, a fast-paced hack&amp;slash where a band of musicians take down an alien invasion!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as 4 characters at the same time, each with their own moveset!<br></li><li>Smoothly navigate through the ruins of Las Divas using slick parkour moves.<br></li><li>Style your way through waves of enemies, what's the point of saving the world if you don't look cool doing it?<br></li><li>Follow the bombastic tale of this band of misfits as they make the impossible, possible.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/576cd0b7fcd2e190d46e35e48da58be6.poster.avif?t=1753714995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/576cd0b7fcd2e190d46e35e48da58be6.webm?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/576cd0b7fcd2e190d46e35e48da58be6.mp4?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A bizarre music band named Genokids is rocking one of their best concerts to date when <strong>The Infinite Empire of Zenodia</strong> decides to invade Earth and assimilate mankind, landing right on top of the band and ruining both their concert and mood.<br><br>Seamlessly swap between all four characters in the middle of a fight. Execute multiple actions at the same time!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/2236caa99c250b19680b6159c51228ec.poster.avif?t=1753714995\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1239360/extras/2236caa99c250b19680b6159c51228ec.webm?t=1753714995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\